codex
The custody changes preserve C3’s limits and the 21 Oct hybrid deadline. The main issues are in the new historical-trust rules: the KSK reliance period needs a clearer forgery boundary, and verdict stability needs to distinguish the fixed V1 result from later algorithm assessments. I’m also checking the A9.7 rows and the location of the proposed git-format field.
